# Archival Music Desk Design System (`apps/web`)

Full reference: [`.agents/rules/archival-music-desk-design.md`](../../.agents/rules/archival-music-desk-design.md) and [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).
Figma origin: `https://www.figma.com/design/zY5UlhIZAQxmeBcW9MTq1q` (Direction 1: Archival Music Desk)

## Key Invariants
- **Palette**: Ivory Parchment (`#F7F5F0` / `#FAF8F3`), Smoked Ebony (`#141312` / `#1E1C1A`), Iron Gall Charcoal (`#242321` / `#EDE8DF`), Terracotta (`#9A2A2A` / `#A04B32`), Patina Jade (`#3B6E57`), Burnished Brass (`#C5A059`). Zero neon or cyber gradients.
- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (headlines/scores), Geist Mono (telemetry/HUD/pitch/frets), Space Grotesk (brand logo), Inter & DM Sans (UI body).
- **Guitar Diagrams**: Separate frets from fingers; embed finger digits in dots; render vector `O` and `X` above nut; show base fret ordinals ("1st", "2nd").
- **Piano Visualizer**: Zero guitar fretboard leakage; 2-pass SVG key stacking (white then black); color-code LH (Terracotta) and RH (Patina Jade); render Middle C anchor; Grand Staff with Treble + Bass clefs and dynamic ledger lines.
- **Audio & Motion**: Karplus-Strong guitar, multi-partial acoustic piano, wooden metronome click; Lenis smooth scroll; zero unprompted microphone access.
